# Authentication System Guidelines

## Core Authentication
- **Login Method**: Users login with unique alphanumeric/numeric IDs (NOT email)
- **SUPER ADMIN**: Role with full system access and user management capabilities
- **Protected Routes**: Use ProtectedRoute component for authentication checks
- **Context**: Authentication state managed in [src/contexts/AuthContext.tsx](mdc:src/contexts/AuthContext.tsx)

## User Management (SUPER ADMIN only)
- **Create Users**: SUPER ADMIN can create new users with auto-generated unique IDs
- **Edit Users**: Update user information, roles, and reset passwords
- **Delete Users**: Remove users (cannot delete self)
- **User Management Page**: [src/app/dashboard/user-management/page.tsx](mdc:src/app/dashboard/user-management/page.tsx)

## Unique ID System
- **Format**: `ROLE###` (e.g., SUPER001, ADMIN001, PMT001, QC001, QA001)
- **Auto-Generation**: Automatically generates next available ID for each role
- **Role Prefixes**: SUPER, ADMIN, PMT, QC, QA, SQC, DQ, CA

## Role-Based Access Control
- **SUPER_ADMIN**: Full system access + user management
- **ADMIN**: Administrative access
- **PMT**: PMT module access
- **QC_MANAGER**: QC module access
- **QUALITY_ANALYST**: Analysis module access
- **START_QC**: Start QC access
- **DATA_QUALITY**: Data quality access
- **CONVERGENT_ANALYSIS**: Convergent analysis access

## Authentication Patterns
- Use `useAuth()` hook for authentication state
- Check `isAuthenticated` before rendering protected content
- Use `hasRole()` and `hasPermission()` for access control
- Redirect to `/login` for unauthenticated users
- Redirect to `/unauthorized` for insufficient permissions

## Demo Accounts
- SUPER001 / super123 (Super Admin)
- ADMIN001 / admin123 (Admin)
- PMT001 / pmt123 (PMT Manager)
- QC001 / qc123 (QC Manager)
- QA001 / analyst123 (Quality Analyst)

## Security Considerations
- Passwords stored in localStorage (demo only - use proper backend in production)
- Session persistence with remember me option
- Automatic logout on token expiration
- Role-based menu filtering in [src/lib/menu-data.ts](mdc:src/lib/menu-data.ts)